# PRODUCTION frontend (AWS Amplify, app.ownerstalent.com)
# TEMPLATE, safe to commit. In Amplify set this in: App settings > Environment variables.
# Vite builds this value INTO the website: changing it needs a new build/deploy.
# Anything starting with VITE_ is visible to everyone in the browser: never put a secret here.
# Must end with /api and use https (the website is https; an http API would be blocked).
VITE_API_URL=https://api.ownerstalent.com/api
